# Day 30 – Supply Chain Optimizer

## Project Overview
Built an interactive Supply Chain Optimizer using Claude and React that helps users understand supply chain management through an enterprise-style simulation.

## Features
- Random company generation
- Supplier strategy selection
- Factory location planning
- Warehouse optimization
- Transportation selection
- Inventory strategy
- Live business metrics
- Supply Chain Score Dashboard
- Replay functionality

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- React (CDN)
- Babel JSX

## Key Learnings
- Supply chain optimization principles
- Cost vs speed trade-offs
- Risk management
- Inventory planning
- Transportation strategies
- Warehouse optimization
- Enterprise dashboard design
- React component architecture

## Outcome
Successfully created a fully interactive offline Supply Chain Optimizer that simulates real-world logistics and operations decisions while providing live business insights.
